## SQ-LBS-04 | host set to air: label and written note drop, cell air (zlbs refit, after -01 and -03)
@group A
@commands `/zlbs refit` after -01 and -03 (hosts set to air with `setBlockAndUpdate`, flag 3); first line is a control: a wall torch on a stone host that goes to air; last line (10 ticks later) a piston pushing a noted stone host. By hand once: a labelled stone broken in survival
@pass control: a torch drops; every host: the label (blank) and the note (with its Text) drop as item entities at the cell, the cell is air (20 of 20); piston line PASS (note dropped with Text, cell air); survival break drops the label
@fails control drops nothing too: every block drop is skipped (Creative Worldgen `FirstTickWater` flag; needs the 2026-11-03 Worldgen jar, which clears it each level tick); control drops but paper does not: `FacePaperInteractions.hostChanged` / `refit`
@jars creativelabels
@sources feature_writeup/sticky_notes.md
@tier T2
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb
# probe hosts at x 300..348, z 20..44 (zlbs_probe.js); forceload added r1120fix 2026-11-20
> forceload add 296 16 351 47
sleep 3
> zlbs refit
waitlog \[zlbs\] DONE refit 60
count \[zlbs\] PASS refit == 20
reject \[zlbs\] FAIL
look the label drops are blank (no NBT), the note drops carry their Text

